                "markdown": "Enabled by default | Safe | Supports autocorrection | VersionAdded | VersionChanged\n--- | --- | --- | --- | ---\nEnabled | Yes | Yes  | 0.75 | -\n\nCheck that cop names in rubocop:disable comments are given with\ndepartment name.\n"
